<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>CPP-API: Abstract interface for custom progress report receivers. </para>



<para>Each #Importer instance maintains its own <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_progress_handler_1a9ce9dc7ed454b321d25ba8a57fb5d44c">ProgressHandler</link>. The default implementation provided by <link linkend="_namespace_assimp">Assimp</link> doesn&apos;t do anything at all. </para>
</section>
